OL,3,AGerman Chancellor Merz calls state
OL,4,Aelection a 'disaster' for his party but
OL,5,Avows to stay on
OL,6,
OL,7,FGerman Chancellor Friedrich Merz has
OL,8,Fcalled two local election defeats for
OL,9,Fhis party, the Christian Democratic
OL,10,FUnion (CDU), a "disaster" but vowed to
OL,11,Fremain in post.
OL,13,FIn the north-eastern state of
OL,14,FMecklenburg-Vorpommern, the CDU fell
OL,15,Fshort of a 5% threshold to enter
OL,16,Fparliament, underperforming against
OL,17,Fwhat had already been projected to be
OL,18,Fthe party's worst ever result in the
OL,19,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
