OL,3,AGerman Chancellor Merz calls state
OL,4,Aelection a 'disaster' for his party but
OL,5,Avows to stay on
OL,6,
OL,7,FFar-right Alternative for Germany (AfD)
OL,8,Fwas on track to win the most votes in
OL,9,FMecklenburg-Vorpommern, but it is
OL,10,Funlikely to govern as other parties
OL,11,Frefuse to work with it.
OL,13,FMeanwhile in Berlin, the ruling CDU was
OL,14,Fon course to be beaten by Die Linke
OL,15,F(The Left).
